// Sorting by an unmapped field (unmapped_event_duration) causes ResolveUnmapped to demand-load it directly into EsRelation.output(),
// placing it BEFORE the $$unmapped_fields synthetic column. DetermineUnmappedFieldsToKeep then adds it to the pattern's exact-excludes
// so it is not re-expanded from _unmapped_fields. The remaining unmapped leaves (unmapped.nested, unmapped_message) are appended after
// the demand-loaded column by the coordinator's ExpandUnmappedFieldsPostProcessor, yielding
// unmapped_event_duration | unmapped.nested | unmapped_message � a different order than the all-expansion case above
// (unmapped.nested | unmapped_event_duration | unmapped_message).
twoSuccessiveDropsThenSortOnUnmappedField
required_capability: optional_fields_load_all_v2

